{"ref":"BDB, עָלַץ","hw":"עָלַץ","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">עָלַץ</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. rejoice, exult (</strong>NH <em>id.</em> (rare); Hiph. Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יעליצו</span> Ecclus 4:20; Assyrian <em>elêṣu</em>, <em>exult;</em> Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">מעלץ</span> <em>joys</em> CIS <sup>iv, No. 197, 1. 5. 7</sup>; v. also <a data-ref=\"BDB, לָז\" href=\"/BDB,_לָז\", dir=\"rtl\">עלז</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, עָלַס\" href=\"/BDB,_עָלַס\", dir=\"rtl\">עלס</a><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ לִבִּ׳ בְּי׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.1\">1 S 2:1</a> <em>my heart exulteth in</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַעֲלֹץ הַשָּׂדֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:32\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.32\">1 Ch 16:32</a> <em>the field exulteth;</em> cf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּעֲלֹץ קִרְיָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.10\">Pr 11:10</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רנן</span>); 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶעֶלְצָה בָּ֑ךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:3\" href=\"/Psalms.9.3\">ψ 9:3</a> (i.e. in <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>; + <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂמה</span>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">זמּר</span>); 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַעְלְצוּ בְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 5:12\" href=\"/Psalms.5.12\">ψ 5:12</a> (in <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂמח</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רנן</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">יַעַלְצוּ לִפְנֵי אֱלֹהִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:4\" href=\"/Psalms.68.4\">68:4</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂמח</span>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂישׂ</span>); + <span dir=\"rtl\">לִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 25:2\" href=\"/Psalms.25.2\">25:2</a> <em>exult at me;</em> Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּעֲלֹץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.12\">Pr 28:12</a> <em>when</em> the righteous <em>exult</em>.","next":"BDB, עֲלִיצוּת","prev":"BDB, עֻלְפֶּה"}